# The shared senses, loads and scale of the five eras (the device rule, the author 2026-10-23: story reaches the
# player through weight, sound, touch, bodies and changed places, never through a document; design/DEVICE-AUDIT.md).
# Engine: world/senses.mjs (@sense), world/burden.mjs (@load, @scale), world/echo.mjs (@echo), played in the shell by
# ui/senseplayer.mjs. Each era's own senses live in its own files with its prefix (e1., q., e3., e4., e5.); these are
# the ones every era uses. Gate: tools/devicecheck.mjs, tools/echocheck.mjs. Weighted-devices pass, 2026-10-23.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the body under a load (fired by world/burden.mjs)
@sense burden.shoulder
sound: thud 0.55 near
caption: a sack landing on a shoulder
rumble: 0.55 0.15 180
camera: dip 0.25 0.5

@sense burden.setdown
sound: thud 0.45 near
caption: a load set down
rumble: 0.25 0.05 120

@sense burden.bent
anim: player bent
rumble: 0.2 0 260

@sense burden.stagger
anim: player stagger
sound: breath 0.35 near 2
caption: hard breathing under the weight
rumble: 0.45 0.1 400
camera: dip 0.4 0.9

@sense burden.upright
anim: player upright

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the exchange scale (era 1's market, era 2's instrument)
@scale q.exchange_scale
name: The exchange scale
sense: scale.tip

@sense scale.tip
sound: creak 0.6 near 1.6
caption: the iron arm of the scale moving
rumble: 0.35 0.1 420
camera: push 1.3 1.2

@sense scale.drop
sound: creak 0.8 near 1.2
sound: thud 0.5 near
caption: the scale's arm dropping hard on its stop
rumble: 0.8 0.3 260
screen: shake 0.25 0.35
camera: push 1.5 1

@sense scale.rise
sound: creak 0.5 near 2
caption: the scale's arm coming up, slowly
rumble: 0.15 0.25 600
camera: push 1.3 1.6

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the loads
@load q.load.sack
name: A sack of grain
weight: 32

@load q.load.sack_light
name: A famine sack, half chaff
weight: 11
line: It comes up too easily. Your arms were ready for twice it.

@load q.load.seed
name: A sack of seed barley
weight: 25

@load q.load.wedge
name: Walter Mott's iron wedge
weight: 3
line: A wedge of iron the size of a hand, cold through the coat lining. You feel it against your ribs every step.

@load q.load.child
name: A child
weight: 22

@load q.load.bucket
name: A pail of water
weight: 10

@load q.load.coat
name: A boy's coat
weight: 2

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the thread (the Hesh mark: held, cut, tied)
@sense thread.hold
sound: breath 0.2 near 1.4
caption: someone breathing close
rumble: 0.08 0.12 500
camera: push 1.6 1.4
hold: 0.8

@sense thread.cut
sound: snip 0.6 near
caption: a blade through thread
screen: shake 0.12 0.2
rumble: 0.05 0.7 90
anim: player flinch 0.6
hold: 1.2

@sense thread.snap
sound: snap 0.6 near
caption: a thread snapping
rumble: 0.05 0.8 70
hold: 1

@sense thread.tie
sound: breath 0.25 near 1.6
caption: a slow breath out
rumble: 0.1 0.2 160
rumble: 0.1 0.2 160 260
camera: push 1.5 1.6
hold: 1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- hands, doors, rooms
@sense sack.drag
sound: drag 0.6 near 2.4
caption: a sack dragged over stones
rumble: 0.4 0.1 700

@sense sand.pour
sound: pour 0.7 near 2.6
caption: sand pouring out onto the stones
rumble: 0.15 0.35 1600
camera: push 1.6 1.8

@sense grain.pour
sound: pour 0.55 near 2.4
caption: grain running out of a split sack
rumble: 0.1 0.3 1400

@sense door.knock
sound: knock 0.6 near
caption: a knock at the door
rumble: 0.3 0 60
rumble: 0.3 0 60 230
rumble: 0.3 0 60 460

@sense wall.voice
sound: knock 0.25 wall
caption: a voice through the wall
screen: vignette 0.35 3
hold: 1.2

@sense door.latch
sound: latch 0.5 near
caption: a latch lifting
rumble: 0.15 0.1 200

@sense door.bar
sound: thud 0.9 near
caption: the oak bar dropping into its brackets
screen: shake 0.35 0.4
rumble: 1 0.4 300

@sense door.blows
sound: knock 0.9 near 1.2
caption: fists on the door
screen: shake 0.3 1.2
rumble: 0.7 0.2 140
rumble: 0.7 0.2 140 300
rumble: 0.7 0.2 140 600
rumble: 0.9 0.3 180 900

@sense chair.empty
sound: chair 0.3 near
caption: a chair scraped back in an empty room
screen: dim 0.2 3
hold: 1

@sense room.cold
screen: tint #9fb4c8 0.12 4
sound: breath 0.15 near 2
caption: your own breath in a cold room

@sense room.burnt
screen: tint #3a2a1e 0.25 5
screen: vignette 0.45 5
sound: drip 0.3 near 4
caption: water dripping in a burnt room

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the body
@sense breath.held
sound: breath 0.3 near 2.4
caption: a breath held
screen: vignette 0.3 2.4
hold: 1.4

@sense heart.fast
sound: heart 0.55 under 3
caption: your heart, fast
rumble: 0.35 0 70
rumble: 0.2 0 70 160
rumble: 0.35 0 70 540
rumble: 0.2 0 70 700
screen: vignette 0.4 3

@sense hands.shake
anim: player tremble 3
rumble: 0.05 0.25 900
hold: 0.8

@sense blow.taken
screen: shake 0.5 0.4
screen: flash 0.25 0.2
rumble: 1 0.6 220
anim: player flinch 1
sound: thud 0.8 near
caption: a blow landing

@sense cold.iron
rumble: 0.05 0.9 160
screen: tint #c8d8e8 0.18 1.5
anim: player flinch 0.6

@sense growth
sound: breath 0.25 near 2
caption: a long breath out
rumble: 0.1 0.1 300

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- what the town keeps (ui/recordmarks.mjs: in place of the rubber stamp)
@sense record.felt
sound: thud 0.3 under 0.8
caption: something heavy set down, somewhere below
rumble: 0.3 0 260
screen: vignette 0.18 1.4
